    <preface>
      <p>Customs Tariff Amendment (Incorporation of Proposals) Act (No. 1) 2024</p>
      <p>No. 22, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Customs Tariff Act 1995</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
